Project: ML-Based Compiler Error Classification
Author: Roll 24CSB0A25

Run:
python src/main.py

Agentic AI Module:
python src/agentic_model.py --error "error: expected ';' before '}' token"
python src/agentic_model.py --log-file build.log --json

Group Files (shared):
- src/parser.py        -> extracts compiler errors from logs
- src/fixer.py         -> builds fix actions and reasoning
- src/agentic_model.py -> orchestrates the agent loop